story += [p('ABSTRACT', 'CoverTitle'), Spacer(1,.1*inch), p('AI Powered EchoChat Application is a web-based language-exchange and communication platform developed to help learners find suitable partners and practice a new language through real-time interaction. Language learners often have access to grammar resources and vocabulary tools, but they lack a focused environment for meaningful communication practice. Existing social or messaging applications provide communication but do not combine language matching, secure profiles, real-time chat, video calling, and contextual AI assistance in one learning-oriented system.', 'BodyNoIndent'), p('The proposed solution uses React and Vite for the frontend, Node.js and Express.js for the backend, and MongoDB for persistent user and friend-request data. JWT authentication and bcrypt password hashing are used to secure user access. Stream Chat and Stream Video are integrated for real-time messaging and video calling. Gemini AI is accessed through the backend for multilingual assistance, including general language queries, translation, and language detection.', 'BodyNoIndent'), p('The application allows users to register, complete a language profile, discover other users, manage friend requests, communicate with friends, and use an AI assistant while learning. The project demonstrates how modern web technologies and cloud communication services can be combined to provide an interactive and secure language-learning experience. Future work can extend the platform with language-level tests, group conversations, learning plans, moderation, and personalized matching scores.', 'BodyNoIndent'), PageBreak()]

