# Chapter 1 pages 1-3
story += [p('CHAPTER 1', 'CoverTitle'), p('INTRODUCTION', 'CoverTitle'), p('1.1 Overview and Issues Involved', 'Main'), p('Language learning requires active use of a language in addition to reading grammar material. Learners need opportunities to listen, speak, write, and receive feedback. In practice, finding a compatible language partner is difficult because learners may not know other people who are studying the same language. General social-media and messaging applications enable conversation, but they are not designed around language goals, profile-based matching, or multilingual help.', 'Body'), p('EchoChat addresses this gap by creating a dedicated environment for language exchange. A user records native and learning languages during onboarding. The application then supports user discovery, friend connections, real-time chat, and video calling. A built-in AI assistant helps a learner understand unfamiliar text without leaving the platform.', 'Body'), p('The primary issues considered in the project are secure identity management, profile completeness, user discovery, reliable real-time communication, controlled access to Stream tokens, and safe handling of Gemini API credentials. The project therefore uses a clear client-server architecture with protected backend APIs.', 'Body'), p('1.2 Problem Definition', 'Main'), p('There is no single, learner-focused web application that allows a language learner to find compatible partners, communicate through chat and video, and receive quick AI-assisted translation or language support in one secure workflow. As a result, learners use multiple disconnected tools and may still lack consistent real-time communication practice.', 'Body'), PageBreak()]
story += [p('1.3 Proposed Solution', 'Main'), p('AI Powered EchoChat Application is a real-time language-exchange platform. It provides secure registration and login, profile onboarding, user recommendations, friend requests, one-to-one chat, video calls, and AI assistance. The application is designed as a web system so that users can access it from a modern browser without installing a separate mobile application.', 'Body'), p('The system is better suited to this problem than a general messaging platform because profile information is directly related to language exchange. A user can indicate the language they know and the language they want to learn. The application separates onboarding, social connection, communication, and AI assistance into a guided experience.', 'Body')]
story += diagram('Figure 1.1: Proposed Solution Flow', ['Register and Login Securely', 'Complete Language Profile', 'Discover Suitable Learners', 'Send or Accept Friend Request', 'Chat and Video Call', 'Use Gemini AI Assistance'])
